<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins generally $2.00 lower; butts mostly 2.00 higher; skinned hams 17-20 lbs. steady to 1.00 higher, 20-26 lbs. steady to 1.00 lower; seedless bellies steady to  1.00 higher; lean trimmings steady to 2.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading very slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings.-USDA</p>
